        note right of MedBuddySavedMedicationViewModel
            Save continuations belong to one account and save generation.
            Clear/dispose prevents subsequent saves, photo attachment and refresh.
            An already accepted server write is not rolled back by local cancellation.
        end note
        note right of MedBuddyReminderViewModel
            Reminder writes and reconciliation are serialized.
            A stale read cannot overwrite a newer save or re-arm a closed session.
            A non-daily slot with no dose today keeps its reminder setting.
        end note
        note right of MedBuddyUserSettingViewModel
            Reads, manual saves and device-language updates share one queue.
            Startup, locale changes and resume synchronize system-language mode.
            Failed saves retain local edits; disposed sessions cannot publish.
        end note

        note right of MedBuddyViewModel
            기존 화면 API를 유지하는 조립·위임 경계이다.
            기능별 상태·진행 요청을 분리하고 종료되거나
            오래된 응답이 다른 기능 상태를 덮어쓰지 않게 한다.
        end note

